    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\nF077B2091FB2A5F27B6176BA157EAF517AC333D76467B2CE2B8EFAA811CF32028DAC5EEEF1DE\n\n### qTox Version\n\n1.18.2\n\n### Commit Hash\n\n_No response_\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Qt Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start qTox\n2. Start call with friend\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nCan only hear them in my left ear.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nStereo audio\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nAlways\n\n### Operating System\n\nLinux, Windows 11\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nArch Linux, Pipewire, KDE\nWindows 11\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nhttps://limewire.com/d/9ad5665b-e911-44fb-a39c-2391da6f417c#PZ6Tz8e_t5SmBZbmHqVQPY31G8CkxUJnev8ZSH_gVXo\n```",
